dasht-e-bala mein sarwar basti basa rahe hain<br>
yasrab ke rahne wale aansoo baha rahe hain<br>
<br>
1. ubhra hassan ke qath se har ek lafz-e-ulfat<br>
tahreer pao ke moula aansoo baha rahe hain<br>
<br>
2. sarvar se keh rahe hain shahed se bhi shiri<br>
kya maut ka mazaa hain qasim bata rahe hain<br>
<br>
3. jis naazni ko sarwar dulha bana chuke kal<br>
us naazni ki mayyat sarwar utha rahe hain<br>
<br>
4. kohram ek barpa hai ehle haram mein harsoo<br>
dulha ki laash rakhney masnad bicha rahe hain<br>
<br>
5. farwa dulhan ko zainab laashe pe leke boli<br>
sehrey ke phool sabko phir khoon rula rahe hain